---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for McKnight & Associates — how we collect, use, and protect your information."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        How McKnight <span class="amp">&amp;</span> Associates collects, uses, and protects
        your information.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--narrow prose">
      <p><em>Last updated: 2026</em></p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you fill out a contact form or reach out to us by phone, email, or SMS, we
        collect the information you provide — typically your name, contact details, and
        a description of what you're looking for in a real estate transaction. We do not
        buy contact lists or scrape data.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your information solely to respond to your inquiry, follow up about
        properties or services relevant to what you asked about, and maintain records
        required by Texas real estate regulations. We do not sell your information to
        third parties.
      </p>

      <h2>Communications</h2>
      <p>
        By submitting the contact form or providing your phone number, you consent to
        receiving calls, emails, and text messages from McKnight <span class="amp">&amp;</span>
        Associates related to your inquiry. Message and data rates may apply. You can
        opt out of SMS by replying STOP, or ask to be removed from our email or call
        list at any time by contacting us.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may use standard cookies for basic functionality and anonymous
        usage analytics. We do not use cookies to identify individual visitors.
      </p>

      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>
        We share information only when necessary to serve you — for example, with the
        title company or lender handling your transaction, or with government agencies
        when required by law. We never share your information for marketing purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy? Reach us at
        <a href="mailto:Lewis@mcknight.com">Lewis@mcknight.com</a> or
        <a href="tel:+12147404989">214-740-4989</a>.
      </p>

      <p style="color:var(--color-muted);font-size:0.9rem;margin-top:3rem;">
        This is a starting-point privacy notice. Before launch, please have it reviewed
        by an attorney familiar with Texas real estate and TCPA/CAN-SPAM rules.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background: var(--color-bg-soft);
    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }

  .amp { color: var(--color-brand); font-weight: 700; }

  .prose h2 {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .prose p {
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
</style>
